        <body>
            <div xml:id="d213">

                <pb facs="0201" n="127" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg127"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr. Hunter</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 18, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my note to Mr. Seward, of
                    the 3d instant, I have the honor to transmit copies of a despatch, and of its
                    enclosure, which I have received from the governor general of Canada, from which
                    it would appear that there is no foundation for Mr.——‘s statements.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, sir, your most obedient, humble
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Hunter,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>










